The Pale is a growth that spreads across the prime material. It began small and was never turned back; those who studied it could only watch it spread, and in time it covered the old landmasses of [[Geography/Ushas/index|Ushas]]. [[People/Dorcan|Dorcan]] remade Ushas's landmasses out of the Pale afterward, and the people there live on ground the Pale once made.

The seam where the Pale meets the prime material was studied closely while it spread. A thing caught at the edge of [[Phenomena/The Slip|the slip]] can be pulled back out the same way.
